   "he": "אִם הָיָה מַשְׂכִּירוֹ לַאֲחֵרִים, אֲפִילּוּ מָצָא בְּתוֹךְ הַבַּיִת – הֲרֵי אֵלּוּ שֶׁלּוֹ. וְאַמַּאי? לֵיזִיל בָּתַר בָּתְרָא.",
   "en": "§ The mishna teaches: «If» the homeowner «would rent» the house «to others» on a regular basis and there was a steady turnover of residents, «even» if one found lost items «inside the house, these» belong «to him.» The Gemara asks: «And why» do they belong to the finder? «Let us follow the last» renter and determine that he is the owner of the items."
  }
